      "content": "i've seen the professionals. they just offer these little coping mechanisms and \"grounding exercises\" like that's gonna bring my life back. it's just a way to manage the misery, not actually fix the fact that i'm nothing now. it feels so permanent. like, i'm just drifting in this empty space and there's no way to climb back onto solid ground. everything i was is just... dead. i'm just waiting for the rest of me to catch up.",
